#: ../../../src/python/_autosummary/mlx.core.qqmm.rst:2
msgid "mlx.core.qqmm"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../docstring of mlx.core.qqmm:1
msgid ""
"Perform a matrix multiplication using a possibly quantized weight matrix "
"``w`` and a non-quantized input ``x``. The input ``x`` is quantized on the "
"fly. The weight matrix ``w`` is used as-is if it is already quantized; "
"otherwise, it is quantized on the fly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../docstring of mlx.core.qqmm:6
msgid ""
"If ``w`` is quantized, ``scales`` must be provided, and ``group_size``, "
"``bits``, and ``mode`` must match the parameters that were used to quantize "
"``w``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../docstring of mlx.core.qqmm:11
msgid "Notes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../docstring of mlx.core.qqmm:12
msgid ""
"If ``w`` is expected to receive gradients, it must be provided in non-"
"quantized form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../docstring of mlx.core.qqmm:15
msgid ""
"If ``x`` and `w`` are not quantized, their data types must be ``float32``, "
"``float16``, or ``bfloat16``. If ``w`` is quantized, it must be packed in "
"unsigned integers. ``global_scale_x`` and ``global_scale_w`` are only used "
"for ``nvfp4`` quantization."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../src/python/_autosummary/mlx.core.qqmm.rst:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../docstring of mlx.core.qqmm:20
msgid "Input array."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../docstring of mlx.core.qqmm:22
msgid "Weight matrix. If quantized, it is packed in unsigned integers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../docstring of mlx.core.qqmm:24
msgid ""
"The scales to use per ``group_size`` elements of ``w`` if ``w`` is "
"quantized. Default: ``None``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../docstring of mlx.core.qqmm:27
msgid ""
"Number of elements in ``x`` and ``w`` that share a scale. See supported "
"values and defaults in the :ref:`table of quantization modes <quantize-"
"modes>`. Default: ``None``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../docstring of mlx.core.qqmm:31
msgid ""
"Number of bits used to represent each element of ``x`` and ``w``. See "
"supported values and defaults in the :ref:`table of quantization modes "
"<quantize-modes>`. Default: ``None``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../docstring of mlx.core.qqmm:35
msgid ""
"The quantization mode. Default: ``\"nvfp4\"``. Supported modes are ``nvfp4`` "
"and ``mxfp8``. See the :ref:`table of quantization modes <quantize-modes>` "
"for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../docstring of mlx.core.qqmm:39
msgid ""
"The per-input float32 scale used for x with ``\"nvfp4\"`` quantization. "
"Default: ``None``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../docstring of mlx.core.qqmm:42
msgid ""
"The per-input float32 scale used for w with ``\"nvfp4\"`` quantization. "
"Default: ``None``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../src/python/_autosummary/mlx.core.qqmm.rst:0
msgid "Returns"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../docstring of mlx.core.qqmm:46
msgid ""
"The result of the multiplication of quantized ``x`` with quantized ``w``. "
"needed)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../src/python/_autosummary/mlx.core.qqmm.rst:0
msgid "Return type"
msgstr ""
